		<description><![CDATA[Since we&#8217;ve essentially got two brains we have a nice social advantage.  If an empath is unintelligent, they may still have the advantage of multi-generational emotional knowlage.  That is dependant on wise careful parenting.  This scenario is almost common knowledge.  Even possibly a stereotype.  One pop culture example might be Forest Gump.  Guided by simple [&#8230;]]]></description>
				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<div class="simplesocialbuttons">
<div class="simplesocialbutton ssb-button-twitter"><!-- Twitter--><a href="https://twitter.com/share" class="twitter-share-button" data-text="Don&#8217;t call me stupid!" data-url="http://civgene.matthewnewhall.com/archives/276" rel="nofollow"></a></div>
<div class="simplesocialbutton ssb-button-googleplus"><!-- Google Plus One--><div class="g-plusone" data-size="medium" data-href="http://civgene.matthewnewhall.com/archives/276"></div></div>
